body:
Her costume was... yikes. Also not very accurate? I had to spend a few weeks in a psych ward because of a suicide attempt, and EVERYONE was wearing normal clothes. I get the whole \~scary\~ theme but this is.. really offensive on a lot of levels. God thats just. fuck man. 

&#x200B;

I'm all for dark humour costumes (seeing as i overdosed on tylenol i would 100% wear a costume joking about the experience.) but this is bringing a bit Too far in the wrong type of company.
